+    # The USD shader translator for the cycles context. It only exists to
+    # carry the material's settings - the Cycles Material Properties - through
+    # to USD: Houdini only does this fallback in its MaterialX translator,
+    # where it assumes Karma. The rest of the translation remains Houdini's,
